offline = Connect to this machine before answering.
unconfirmed = The answer could not be confirmed. Check whether the request still waits before trying again.
busy = This request is already being answered. Wait for its result.
exhausted = Reopen this window before answering again.
unsupported = This machine cannot accept this answer. Update it before trying again.
invalid = The answer did not match this request. Reload the conversation.
unsent = Could not send the answer. Try again.
refused = The machine refused the answer. Check the request and try again.
